  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in a multiprofile multimodal model with concat fusion, comparing it to avgpool (config_004). Validation accuracy of 0.5793 is lower than avgpool's 0.6186, suggesting transformer aggregation may not achieve the same performance. However, the relative contribution of aggregation method versus other factors remains uncertain without further isolation."
